			<item>
				<title>How to Fix the M4 Does Not Match EMB Version Error!(70000021 info(00000015)</title>
				<link>https://kimi2000nb.github.io/docs/troubleshooting/error-code/the-m4-does-not-match-emb-version/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://kimi2000nb.github.io/docs/troubleshooting/error-code/the-m4-does-not-match-emb-version/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;one-update-step-was-not-completed&#34;&gt;One update step was not completed.&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#one-update-step-was-not-completed&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The &amp;ldquo;The M4 Does Not Match EMB Version&amp;rdquo; error is caused by an incomplete system update. One update step was not completed.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;card rounded p-2 td-post-card mb-4 mt-4&#34; style=&#34;max-width: 710px&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img class=&#34;card-img-top&#34; src=&#34;https://kimi2000nb.github.io/docs/troubleshooting/error-code/the-m4-does-not-match-emb-version/M4_hu_ba2237bbb9492829.jpg&#34; width=&#34;700&#34; height=&#34;546&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;figcaption class=&#34;card-body px-0 pt-2 pb-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;card-text&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The M4 Does Not Match EMB Version&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;please-complete-this-update-step&#34;&gt;Please complete this update step&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#please-complete-this-update-step&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;card rounded p-2 td-post-card mb-4 mt-4&#34; style=&#34;max-width: 469px&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img class=&#34;card-img-top&#34; src=&#34;https://kimi2000nb.github.io/docs/troubleshooting/error-code/the-m4-does-not-match-emb-version/update_hu_1aae812f8477f4af.png&#34; width=&#34;459&#34; height=&#34;635&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;figcaption class=&#34;card-body px-0 pt-2 pb-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;card-text&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Please complete the second update step.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>How to Fix Main Shaft Error (Error! [10000001] info(00000000))</title>
				<link>https://kimi2000nb.github.io/docs/troubleshooting/error-code/featured-main-shaft-error/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://kimi2000nb.github.io/docs/troubleshooting/error-code/featured-main-shaft-error/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If your machine displays &lt;code&gt;Error! [10000001] info(00000000)&lt;/code&gt;, the main shaft is unable to return to its home position (100°). In most cases, the problem is caused by a mechanical jam rather than an electronic failure.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;symptoms&#34;&gt;Symptoms&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#symptoms&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You may notice one or more of the following:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The machine stops during startup.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The main shaft cannot return to 100°.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The handwheel is difficult or impossible to turn.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The machine displays:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
